# Integrate Firebase Admin Python SDK

Add Firebase Admin SDK initialization in `app.py` for backend Firebase capabilities (`firebase-adminsdk-fbsvc@dermai-skincare-app.iam.gserviceaccount.com`).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The Firebase Admin SDK requires service account credentials. The application will check for `serviceAccountKey.json` (or the path set in the `FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY` environment variable). For security, `serviceAccountKey.json` will be added to `.gitignore`.

